  "product_info": {
    "title": "Lexar JumpDrive D400 Dual 128GB Flash Drive",
    "description": "The <b>Lexar JumpDrive D400 Dual 128GB USB 3.1 Flash Drive</b> is the ultimate portable storage companion for professionals and everyday users. Designed with <b>dual USB Type-C and Type-A connectors,</b> it lets you effortlessly transfer data between laptops, tablets, and smartphones no adapters needed. With <b>USB 3.1 Gen 1</b> technology, enjoy blazing-fast read speeds of up to <b>130MB/s</b>, ensuring your photos, videos, and documents move in seconds. The <b>titanium metal casing</b> and <b>swivel design</b> provide lasting protection and style, while <b>Lexar DataShield encryption</b> keeps your files private and secure. Compact, durable, and universally compatible, the <b>JumpDrive D400</b> is built to handle life on the go combining speed, style, and security in one sleek device.",
